{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30555","headline":"江陵府初试澄心如水 · 卢肇","name":"江陵府初试澄心如水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹心何所喻，唯水并清虚。\n莫测千寻底，难知一勺初。\n内明非有物，上善本无鱼。\n澹泊随高下，波澜逐卷舒。\n养蒙方浩浩，出险每徐徐。\n若灌情田里，常流尽不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}